From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: keep battery diagnostic fields independently valid

Read each existing diagnostic register independently; log failed bytes as
unknown with address/error and per-group validity masks. Do not widen the
SPMI observer whitelist, write PMIC state, or change sampling/publication.

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBattery.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBattery.cpp
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBattery.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBattery.cpp
